B.Wh=new A.iA("How do I book a venue?","To book a venue, browse through our listings, select your preferred venue, choose your event date and time, and complete the booking process by making a payment. You'll receive a confirmation email with your booking details.")
B.Wn=new A.iA("What payment methods do you accept?","We accept various payment methods including credit/debit cards (Visa, Mastercard), GCash, Maya, and bank transfers. All payments are processed securely through our platform.")
B.Wo=new A.iA("Can I cancel or modify my booking?","Yes, you can cancel or modify your booking depending on the venue's cancellation policy. Most venues allow free cancellation up to 24-48 hours before the event. Go to My Events to manage your bookings.")
B.Wk=new A.iA("How do refunds work?","Refunds are processed based on the venue's cancellation policy. If you cancel within the free cancellation period, you'll receive a full refund. Refunds typically take 5-7 business days to process.")
B.Wi=new A.iA("What happens if the venue cancels?","If a venue cancels your booking, you'll receive a full refund plus a credit for a future booking. Our support team will help you find an alternative venue if needed.")
B.Wm=new A.iA("How do I become a host?","To become a host, go to Profile > Switch to hosting > List your place. You'll need to provide venue details, photos, pricing, and availability. Our team will review your listing before it goes live.")
B.Wl=new A.iA("Are there any fees for hosts?","Venu charges a small service fee on each booking (typically 3-5%). There are no upfront costs to list your venue. You keep the majority of your earnings.")
